	)
	(text "Battery plug wired the Adafruit/SparkFun way (pad 1 = +). Cell protection on the minus side\n(OCD ~5.8 A, SCD ~29 A, OV 4.275 V, UV 2.8 V); reverse-battery P-FET on the plus side, on only\nwhen the cell is the right way round. Charge 300 mA. Current-limited cell-to-SYS bypass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 19.05 0)
